cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper and this software release."
title: "kang-oldham-2026: analysis code for consensus co-expression module projection in AD and SCZ"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code reproducing the figures and tables of Kang, Oldham, et al.:
  derivation of consensus co-expression modules from a batch-corrected bulk
  human-cortex RNA-seq megaset and their projection (via the CoPA method) onto
  single-nucleus datasets to identify disease-associated and conserved modules
  in Alzheimer's disease and schizophrenia.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
